<li>Model Export for 3dsmax: see <a rel="nofollow" class="external free" href="http://social.bioware.com/project/563/">http://social.bioware.com/project/563/</a> (Works for static and animated Models, soon to work for Animations. Tutorial needed)</li>
<li>Model Export for Blender: see <a rel="nofollow" class="external free" href="http://social.bioware.com/project/899/">http://social.bioware.com/project/899/</a> (Able to mod Meshes, Tutorial needed)</li></ul>
